# What does NOT ship in the .vsix.
#
# An extension is downloaded by everyone who installs it, so the default — everything in the folder —
# is the wrong default. This is an allow-list in reverse: the grammars, the two entry points, the
# manifest and the two documents a marketplace page is built from.

install.mjs
# For whoever publishes it, not for whoever installs it.
PUBLISHING.md
.vscodeignore
node_modules/**
**/*.map
**/tsconfig.json
**/*.test.*
